    "the model id the API reports (default: the file's name)": "API 返回的模型 ID（默认：文件名）",
    "require <code>Authorization: Bearer KEY</code> or <code>x-api-key</code>": "要求 <code>Authorization: Bearer KEY</code> 或 <code>x-api-key</code>",
    "let the pages of ORIGIN (<code>https://host[:port]</code>, an extension's origin, <code>null</code>) call the inference API from a browser; repeatable; <code>'*'</code>: any page; <code>none</code>: not even this machine's own pages, which may by default. The model panel, the request log and the logs are never another origin's": "允许 ORIGIN（<code>https://host[:port]</code>、扩展的 origin、<code>null</code>）的网页在浏览器中调用推理 API；可重复；<code>'*'</code>：任何网页；<code>none</code>：连本机的网页也不允许（默认允许）。模型面板、请求日志和日志永远不对其他 origin 开放",
    "HTTP worker threads (64): one per request in flight, queued or running": "HTTP 工作线程数（64）：每个进行中的请求（排队或运行）占用一个",
    "also list the <code>.gguf</code> / <code>.flyx</code> files under DIR on the Model page (repeatable; also <code>FLYX_MODELS_DIR</code>)": "在「模型」页也列出 DIR 下的 <code>.gguf</code> / <code>.flyx</code> 文件（可重复；也可用 <code>FLYX_MODELS_DIR</code>）",
    "keep no prompts or answers for the Requests page (kept by default: the last 50, in memory)": "不为「请求」页保存提示词和回答（默认在内存中保存最近 50 条）",
    "keep no log lines for the Logs page (kept by default: the last 2,000, in memory)": "不为「日志」页保存日志行（默认在内存中保存最近 2,000 行）",
    "serve this page's files from DIR where it has them (<code>apps/flyx-server/dashboard</code>): a change shows on a reload, without a build": "从 DIR 提供本页面的文件（DIR 中有的话，即 <code>apps/flyx-server/dashboard</code>）：修改后刷新即可看到，无需重新构建",
    "no dashboard on the terminal; do not open this page": "终端上不显示面板；不打开本页面",
    "log every request": "记录每个请求",
    "requests allowed to wait (16); the longest wait (600 s)": "允许排队等待的请求数（16）；最长等待时间（600 s）",
