    "keep Claude Code's billing line in the system prompt": "在系统提示词中保留 Claude Code 的计费行",
    "context per session (default: <code>max</code> — the model's own, or the longest the GPU and host memory hold)": "每个会话的上下文（默认：<code>max</code>，即模型自身的上下文，或显存和内存能放下的最长上下文）",
    "the K/V cache: fp8 holds twice the context; 16 is llama.cpp's binary16 (the default where 32 GB of GPU memory are left after the weights and on Llama models, else fp8)": "K/V 缓存：fp8 能容纳两倍的上下文；16 即 llama.cpp 的 binary16（权重之外还剩 32 GB 显存时以及 Llama 模型上为默认，否则默认 fp8）",
    "host memory for the K/V past the GPU's part (auto; 0: the context shrinks to fit the GPU)": "用于存放超出显存部分 K/V 的内存（自动；0：上下文缩小到显存能放下）",
    "at most N tokens' K/V on the GPU, the rest in host memory": "显存中最多放 N 个 token 的 K/V，其余放在内存中",
    "<code>auto</code> = <code>auto:2</code> (default), <code>exact</code>, <code>strata</code> = <code>strata:2</code>. <code>auto:3</code> uses a 3-bit scan after the switch.": "<code>auto</code> = <code>auto:2</code>（默认）、<code>exact</code>、<code>strata</code> = <code>strata:2</code>。<code>auto:3</code> 在切换后使用 3-bit 扫描。",
    "a drafter in a file or Hub repository of its own (repeatable): an MTP GGUF, or DFlash2": "独立文件或 Hub 仓库中的 drafter（可重复）：MTP GGUF 或 DFlash2",
    "plain decoding; no drafts from the text where it repeats": "普通解码；不从重复的文本中起草",
    "fix the model drafter's width at N, up to its maximum (default: chosen per round). Prompt lookup can still verify 15 drafts from earlier text. Use <code>--no-lookup</code> to disable it. Not beside a DV drafter: its rounds then run alone, its widest of at most N every round.": "将模型 drafter 的宽度固定为 N，最多到其上限（默认：每轮选择）。提示词查找仍可根据前文验证 15 个草稿。使用 <code>--no-lookup</code> 可关闭它。DV drafter 在用时则不会：此时只运行 DV 的轮次，每轮都取不超过 N 的最大宽度。",
    "drafters also propose trees": "drafter 还会提出树状草稿",
    "prompt rows per prefill pass (1024 to 4096 by free GPU memory)": "每次 Prefill 处理的提示词行数（根据空闲显存取 1024 到 4096）",
    "the GPU, or the float64 reference; <code>CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES</code> picks the GPU": "GPU，或 float64 参考实现；<code>CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES</code> 选择 GPU",
