    "exact: every linear rounds its inputs as its format does; nvfp4: NVFP4 weights take NVFP4 inputs in prefill passes whatever the file says (a GPU with FP4 tensor cores)": "exact：每个线性层按其格式对输入做舍入；nvfp4：无论文件如何设定，NVFP4 权重在 Prefill 时都使用 NVFP4 输入（需要带 FP4 Tensor Core 的 GPU）",
    "a Jinja template file instead of the model's": "用于替代模型自带模板的 Jinja 模板文件",
    "name, version, pid, started_at, uptime_s, api_key_required, agent_launch, cors": "name, version, pid, started_at, uptime_s, api_key_required, agent_launch, cors",
    "id, loaded, device, backend, drafter, max_width, context, chat_format, max_sessions, memory, load_s": "id, loaded, device, backend, drafter, max_width, context, chat_format, max_sessions, memory, load_s",
    "phase, running, queued. The oldest running request supplies label, session, prompt_tokens, prefilled, reused_tokens, generated, tokens_per_round, rounds, drafted, accepted, decode_tok_s, prefill_tok_s and elapsed_s. Chat completions also supply id.": "phase、running、queued。最早运行的请求提供 label、session、prompt_tokens、prefilled、reused_tokens、generated、tokens_per_round、rounds、drafted、accepted、decode_tok_s、prefill_tok_s 和 elapsed_s。Chat Completions 请求还提供 id。",
    "decode_tok_s, tokens_per_round and acceptance (0..1) over the recent window across running requests, plus output_per_second, prefill_per_second (prompt tokens computed), rounds_per_second, drafted_per_second and accepted_per_second over the last 60 seconds": "decode_tok_s、tokens_per_round 和 acceptance（0..1）按所有运行中请求在最近窗口内统计；output_per_second、prefill_per_second（已计算的提示词 token）、rounds_per_second、drafted_per_second 和 accepted_per_second 按最近 60 秒统计",
    "util, mem_used, mem_total, power_w, power_limit_w, temp_c, fan, sm_clock_mhz, pcie_gen, pcie_width, clock_limits, process_host (the process's page-locked host memory, where the system counts it)": "util、mem_used、mem_total、power_w、power_limit_w、temp_c、fan、sm_clock_mhz、pcie_gen、pcie_width、clock_limits、process_host（进程占用的页锁定主机内存，系统统计时提供）",
    "ledger_used, ledger_budget, runtime (FLYX's CUDA runtime beside the ledger, where the system counts it), host_mapped (the K/V's host memory the resident figure misses), sessions (id, tokens)": "ledger_used、ledger_budget、runtime（ledger 之外 FLYX 的 CUDA 运行时占用，系统统计时提供）、host_mapped（常驻内存数值未计入的 K/V 主机内存）、sessions（id、tokens）",
    "finished requests: label, status, prompt, reused and output tokens, queue_ms, ttft_ms (arrival to first output event, null without output), prefill_ms, decode_ms, decode_tok_s, tokens_per_round, drafted, accepted_drafts, tool_calls": "已完成请求：label、status、提示词、复用和输出 token 数、queue_ms、ttft_ms（从请求到达到第一个输出事件，无输出时为 null）、prefill_ms、decode_ms、decode_tok_s、tokens_per_round、drafted、accepted_drafts、tool_calls",
